      "summary": "build_01: Added the isolated root CMake build definition for the Diff registry-invoke operator targeting Ascend910B3.; build_02: Adds an isolated, target-bounded build.sh for the draft Diff operator.; build_03: Added isolated op_host CMake configuration for Diff host definition, shape inference, Ascend910B tiling, ACLNN API libraries, graph proto, and package linkage.; build_04: Stage 4/17 adds the isolated op_kernel CMake target for the Diff Ascend910B3 kernel.; host_01: Added the Diff op_host definition with one float32 input, one float32 output, and the NumPy-compatible axis attribute.; host_02: Implemented Diff shape inference with normalized axis and NumPy-compatible output extent.; host_03: Added arch22 Diff host tiling implementation with float32/static-shape validation, axis normalization, shape checks, workspace declaration, and core/UB tiling parameters.; kernel_01: Added the arch22 kernel entry for Diff, mapping fixed kernel arguments to the templated NsDiff implementation and shared DiffTilingData.; kernel_02: Add the arch22 Diff kernel class header for float32 rank-2 axis-1 differencing with bounded tiling-shape handling.; kernel_03: Added the shared arch22 Diff tiling-data ABI for host tiling and kernel use.; kernel_04: Added the arch22 Diff tiling-key contract with the single float32 template parameter used by host tiling and the kernel entry.; api_01: Added the unverified ACLNN L2 two-stage API declaration for Diff with a single float32 tensor input, explicit axis attribute, and tensor output.; api_02: Drafted the ACLNN L2 API implementation for float32 Diff with axis validation, empty-output handling, and explicit stream synchronization.; api_03: Added the complete L0 ACLNN declaration for Diff matching the fixed first-difference contract with axis.; api_04: Generated complete ACLNN L0 implementation for Diff with float32 rank-2 validation, axis normalization, shape inference, and AI Core launch.; test_adapter_01: Added self-contai